    {
      "v": 3,
      "zh": "弟兄们，我们该为你们常常感谢　神，这本是合宜的；因你们的信心格外增长，并且你们众人彼此相爱的心也都充足。",
      "en": "We ought to thank God always for you, brothers and sisters,[NOTE:1] and rightly so,[NOTE:2] because your faith flourishes more and more and the love of each one of you all for one another is ever greater.",
