      "v": 9,
      "zh": "他们要受刑罚，就是永远沉沦，离开主的面和他权能的荣光。",
      "en": "They[NOTE:1] will undergo the penalty of eternal destruction, away from the presence of the Lord and from the glory of his strength,[NOTE:2]",
